# Book II line-ending policy. Scoped to this directory: it does not affect Book I or the repository root.
# Text is stored and checked out with LF on every platform (also under core.autocrlf=true), because
#  - tests parse the master plan with split('\n') and a byte-exact sha256 is recorded for it,
#  - the committed oracle fixture is compared with Python's output,
#  - Linux visual baselines and the crawler must see identical bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.ico binary
